flowchart LR
    user[User]
    camera[USB Camera]
    enroll[Enrollment Script\nsrc/enroll.py]
    rebuild[DB Rebuild Script\nsrc/rebuild_db.py]
    recognize[Recognition Script\nsrc/recognize.py]
    mqtt_recognize[MQTT Recognition Addon\naddons/mqtt_servo_tracking/recognize_mqtt.py]
    detector[Face Detection + 5-Point Landmarks\nHaar Cascade + MediaPipe]
    aligner[Face Alignment\n112x112 normalized crop]
    embedder[ArcFace Embedder\nONNX Runtime]
    matcher[Face DB Matcher\nCosine Similarity]
    crops[(Enrollment Crops\n data/enroll/*)]
    facedb[(Face Database\n data/db/face_db.npz)]
    metadata[(DB Metadata\n data/db/face_db.json)]
    logs[(Action Logs\n logs/*.txt)]
    broker[MQTT Broker]
    dashboard[Web Dashboard]
    servo[ESP8266 / ESP32 Servo Controller]

    user -->|start capture| enroll
    camera --> enroll
    enroll --> detector --> aligner --> embedder
    embedder -->|sample embeddings| enroll
    enroll -->|save aligned face crops| crops
    enroll -->|save mean embedding| facedb
    enroll -->|save DB metadata| metadata

    crops --> rebuild
    rebuild --> embedder
    rebuild -->|recomputed embeddings| facedb
    rebuild --> metadata

    user -->|run recognition| recognize
    camera --> recognize
    facedb --> recognize
    recognize --> detector
    detector --> aligner
    aligner --> embedder
    embedder --> matcher
    facedb --> matcher
    matcher -->|identity + distance| recognize
    recognize -->|lock/unlock events| logs

    user -->|run servo tracking| mqtt_recognize
    camera --> mqtt_recognize
    facedb --> mqtt_recognize
    mqtt_recognize --> detector
    mqtt_recognize --> aligner
    mqtt_recognize --> embedder
    mqtt_recognize --> matcher
    matcher --> mqtt_recognize
    mqtt_recognize -->|movement commands| broker
    mqtt_recognize -->|status JSON| broker
    broker --> dashboard
    broker --> servo
